<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Screen gallery | Hermes Mobile</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Verified English Android 16 screen captures in light and dark themes from Hermes Mobile.">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="../../assets/favicon.svg">
  <link rel="canonical" href="{{ pages_url }}en/walkthrough/">
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="{{ pages_url }}en/walkthrough/">
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="fr" href="{{ pages_url }}fr/walkthrough/">
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="{{ pages_url }}en/walkthrough/">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Screen gallery | Hermes Mobile">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Explore real English Android 16 light and dark screen captures from Hermes Mobile.">
  <meta property="og:url" content="{{ pages_url }}en/walkthrough/">
  <meta property="og:image" content="{{ pages_url }}assets/marketing/social-preview-en.png">
  <meta property="og:locale" content="en_US">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="{{ pages_url }}assets/marketing/social-preview-en.png">
  <script>(function(){try{var q=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('theme');var s=q==='light'||q==='dark'?q:localStorage.getItem('hermes-site-theme');var t=s==='light'||s==='dark'?s:(matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme:dark)').matches?'dark':'light');document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);}catch(e){}})();</script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../assets/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to gallery</a>

  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="../">
        <img class="brand-mark" src="../../assets/favicon.svg" alt="" width="28" height="28">
        <span>Hermes Mobile</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="../">Overview</a>
        <a href="../docs/">Docs</a>
        <a href="./" class="is-active" aria-current="page">Gallery</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/{{ repository }}" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="nav-actions">
        <a class="lang-link" href="../../fr/walkthrough/" data-lang-switch="fr" hreflang="fr" lang="fr" aria-label="Switch to French gallery">Français</a>
        <button type="button" class="pill-btn" data-theme-toggle aria-pressed="false">Dark</button>
        <a class="topbar-apk" data-latest-apk href="https://github.com/{{ repository }}/releases/latest" rel="noopener">Download APK</a>
        <button type="button" class="menu-btn" data-menu-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-nav" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M4 7h16v2H4V7zm0 4h16v2H4v-2zm0 4h16v2H4v-2z"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="mobile-nav" class="mobile-drawer">
      <nav class="mobile-drawer-links" aria-label="Mobile navigation">
        <a href="../">Overview</a>
        <a href="../docs/">Documentation</a>
        <a href="./" class="is-active" aria-current="page">Screen gallery</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/{{ repository }}" rel="noopener">GitHub repository</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="mobile-drawer-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" data-latest-apk href="https://github.com/{{ repository }}/releases/latest" rel="noopener">Download signed APK</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h1>Android 16 screen gallery</h1>
        <p>Select any capture to inspect it full-size. Switch between Light, Dark, or Both to compare native themes directly.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="filter-controls">
        <div class="filter-bar" role="tablist" aria-label="Filter captures">
          <button type="button" class="showcase-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-gallery-filter="all">All</button>
          <button type="button" class="showcase-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-gallery-filter="screen">Android 16 screens</button>
          <button type="button" class="showcase-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-gallery-filter="overview">Overview visuals</button>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-segment" role="group" aria-label="Screen theme mode">
          <button type="button" data-gallery-mode-btn="light" aria-pressed="true">Light</button>
          <button type="button" data-gallery-mode-btn="dark" aria-pressed="false">Dark</button>
          <button type="button" data-gallery-mode-btn="both" aria-pressed="false">Both</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="gallery-grid" class="gallery-grid" data-gallery-mode="light">
        <article class="capture-card" data-category="screen">
          <div class="capture-media is-phone" role="button" tabindex="0">
            <div class="dual-pair">
              <img class="capture-phone-img capture-phone-primary" src="../../assets/screens/en/command-palette.png" data-src-light="../../assets/screens/en/command-palette.png" data-src-dark="../../assets/screens/dark/en/command-palette.png" data-fixed-theme="1" width="1080" height="2340" alt="Command palette overlay in English showing searchable actions, threads, and templates">
              <img class="capture-phone-img capture-phone-secondary" src="../../assets/screens/dark/en/command-palette.png" data-fixed-theme="1" width="1080" height="2340" loading="lazy" alt="Command palette overlay in English in dark theme">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="capture-body">
            <span class="badge">Android 16 · EN · Light and dark</span>
            <h3>Command palette (Ctrl+K)</h3>
            <p>Accent-insensitive quick jump across native screens, recent discussions, and encrypted templates.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="capture-card" data-category="screen">
          <div class="capture-media is-phone" role="button" tabindex="0">
            <div class="dual-pair">
              <img class="capture-phone-img capture-phone-primary" src="../../assets/screens/en/templates.png" data-src-light="../../assets/screens/en/templates.png" data-src-dark="../../assets/screens/dark/en/templates.png" data-fixed-theme="1" width="1080" height="2340" alt="Everyday workflows panel in English with built-in starters and custom templates">
              <img class="capture-phone-img capture-phone-secondary" src="../../assets/screens/dark/en/templates.png" data-fixed-theme="1" width="1080" height="2340" loading="lazy" alt="Everyday workflows panel in English in dark theme">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="capture-body">
            <span class="badge">Android 16 · EN · Light and dark</span>
            <h3>Everyday workflows</h3>
            <p>Six curated starters and custom per-profile templates that stage editable drafts without auto-sending.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="capture-card" data-category="screen">
          <div class="capture-media is-phone" role="button" tabindex="0">
            <div class="dual-pair">
              <img class="capture-phone-img capture-phone-primary" src="../../assets/screens/en/connection-doctor.png" data-src-light="../../assets/screens/en/connection-doctor.png" data-src-dark="../../assets/screens/dark/en/connection-doctor.png" data-fixed-theme="1" width="1080" height="2340" alt="Live connection doctor panel in English verifying server latency, companion capabilities, push, and updates">
              <img class="capture-phone-img capture-phone-secondary" src="../../assets/screens/dark/en/connection-doctor.png" data-fixed-theme="1" width="1080" height="2340" loading="lazy" alt="Live connection doctor panel in English in dark theme">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="capture-body">
            <span class="badge">Android 16 · EN · Light and dark</span>
            <h3>Connection doctor</h3>
            <p>Six parallel checks, {{ expected_fork_capabilities }}/{{ expected_fork_capabilities }} companion capability probe, and redacted report copy.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="capture-card" data-category="screen">
          <div class="capture-media is-phone" role="button" tabindex="0">
            <div class="dual-pair">
              <img class="capture-phone-img capture-phone-primary" src="../../assets/screens/en/presence-control.png" data-src-light="../../assets/screens/en/presence-control.png" data-src-dark="../../assets/screens/dark/en/presence-control.png" data-fixed-theme="1" width="1080" height="2340" alt="Presence and look panel in English with all optional sharing toggles off by default">
              <img class="capture-phone-img capture-phone-secondary" src="../../assets/screens/dark/en/presence-control.png" data-fixed-theme="1" width="1080" height="2340" loading="lazy" alt="Presence and look panel in English in dark theme">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="capture-body">
            <span class="badge">Android 16 · EN · Light and dark</span>
            <h3>Presence and look</h3>
            <p>Fail-closed opt-in context controls, 1-tap full reset, and WCAG-AA light and dark themes.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="capture-card" data-category="overview">
          <div class="capture-media is-landscape" role="button" tabindex="0">
            <img src="../../assets/marketing/dual-theme-showcase-en.png" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" alt="Light paper and dark paper themes of Hermes Mobile side by side on Android 16">
          </div>
          <div class="capture-body">
            <span class="badge">Overview · Light and dark</span>
            <h3>Dual-theme Android 16 showcase</h3>
            <p>Warm paper light theme and dark paper night theme captured side by side across four real screens.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="capture-card" data-category="overview">
          <div class="capture-media is-landscape" role="button" tabindex="0">
            <img src="../../assets/marketing/app-preview-en.png" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" alt="Four-screen overview of Hermes Mobile in English alternating dark and light paper themes">
          </div>
          <div class="capture-body">
            <span class="badge">Overview · Four workflows</span>
            <h3>Four-screen feature strip</h3>
            <p>Command palette, everyday workflows, presence controls, and connection doctor in one glance.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="capture-card" data-category="overview">
          <div class="capture-media is-landscape" role="button" tabindex="0">
            <img src="../../assets/marketing/hero-studio.png" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" alt="Hermes Mobile paper workspace overview showing inline decision card, QR pairing, admin console, and live Android 16 screens">
          </div>
          <div class="capture-body">
            <span class="badge">Overview · Product sheet</span>
            <h3>Paper workspace overview</h3>
            <p>Editable draft decision card, QR pairing summary, admin console overview, and live Android 16 captures.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="capture-card" data-category="overview">
          <div class="capture-media is-landscape" role="button" tabindex="0">
            <img src="../../assets/marketing/privacy-architecture.png" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" alt="Three-column privacy and security architecture diagram from Android Keystore vault through direct encrypted link to Linux Landlock server">
          </div>
          <div class="capture-body">
            <span class="badge">Overview · Security</span>
            <h3>Privacy and security architecture</h3>
            <p>Keystore AES-256-GCM vault, direct HTTPS or Tailscale transport, opaque push wakeups, and Linux Landlock server isolation.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <div id="lightbox" class="lightbox" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="lightbox-title">
    <div class="lightbox-card">
      <div class="lightbox-head">
        <strong id="lightbox-title">Screen capture</strong>
        <button id="lightbox-close" type="button" class="pill-btn">Close</button>
      </div>
      <img id="lightbox-img" src="../../assets/screens/en/command-palette.png" width="1080" height="2340" alt="Screen capture preview">
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container footer-inner">
      <span>Hermes Mobile · Screen gallery</span>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="../">Overview</a>
        <a href="../docs/">Documentation</a>
        <a href="../../fr/walkthrough/" data-lang-switch="fr" hreflang="fr" lang="fr">Galerie française</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/{{ repository }}" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="../../assets/app.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
